ul.","en":"Let the soil dry a little and check drainage."}}],"airTemperature":{"min":11,"max":24},"light":{"min":400,"max":800},"soilPh":{"min":6,"max":6.8}}'::jsonb, 'FAO EcoCrop database (gaez.fao.org/pages/ecocrop), via the OpenCLIM EcoCrop_DB.csv export'),
